      "summaries": {
        "en": "Quarkdown is a Markdown-based document compiler that transforms simple Markdown files into polished outputs like PDFs, presentations, websites, and books. Its key innovation is a custom scripting language embedded in Markdown, enabling dynamic content generation, conditional rendering, and reusable components without leaving the Markdown ecosystem. You can use it to write academic papers with automatic bibliography management, create slide decks from the same source, or build static sites with live preview. Ideal for researchers, writers, and developers seeking a unified, extensible documentation workflow.",
        "zh": "Quarkdown 是一个基于 Markdown 的文档编译器，能将简单的 Markdown 文件转换为 PDF、演示文稿、网站、书籍等多种精美输出。其核心创新在于内嵌的脚本语言，允许在 Markdown 中直接编写动态内容、条件渲染和可复用组件，无需离开 Markdown 生态。你可以用它撰写学术论文（自动管理参考文献）、从同一源文件生成幻灯片，或构建带实时预览的静态网站。特别适合需要统一、可扩展文档工作流的研究者、写作者和开发者。",
        "es": "Quarkdown is a Markdown-based document compiler that transforms simple Markdown files into polished outputs like PDFs, presentations, websites, and books. Its key innovation is a custom scripting language embedded in Markdown, enabling dynamic content generation, conditional rendering, and reusable components without leaving the Markdown ecosystem. You can use it to write academic papers with automatic bibliography management, create slide decks from the same source, or build static sites with live preview. Ideal for researchers, writers, and developers seeking a unified, extensible documentation workflow.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "quarkdown stands out for compiler, documentation, and knowledge-management in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Quarkdown is a Markdown-based document compiler that transforms simple Markdown files into polished outputs like PDFs, presentations, websites, and books. Its key innovation is a custom scripting language embedded in Markdown, enabling dynamic content generation, conditional rendering, and reusable components without leaving the Markdown ecosystem. You can use it to write academic papers with automatic bibliography management, create slide decks from the same source, or build static sites with live preview. Ideal for researchers, writers, and developers seeking a unified, extensible documentation workflow.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/iamgio/quarkdown for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
