      "summaries": {
        "en": "Ace-Step-UI is an open-source React/TypeScript interface for ACE-Step 1.5, enabling local AI music generation without cloud costs. It leverages a diffusion-based transformer model to produce high-quality audio from text prompts, with full control over generation parameters. Developers can run it locally via Docker or npm, customize the UI, and integrate it into creative tools for unlimited, private music creation.",
        "zh": "Ace-Step-UI 是一个基于 React 和 TypeScript 的开源界面，专为 ACE-Step 1.5 模型设计，让你在本地免费生成 AI 音乐，无需依赖云服务。其核心技术是扩散式 Transformer，能从文本提示生成高质量音频，并支持调整参数以控制输出风格。你可以通过 Docker 或 npm 快速部署，甚至修改 UI 或集成到自己的创意工具中。无论是制作背景音乐、实验声音设计，还是构建音乐生成应用，这个项目都提供了自由、私密且无限生成的解决方案。",
        "es": "Ace-Step-UI is an open-source React/TypeScript interface for ACE-Step 1.5, enabling local AI music generation without cloud costs. It leverages a diffusion-based transformer model to produce high-quality audio from text prompts, with full control over generation parameters. Developers can run it locally via Docker or npm, customize the UI, and integrate it into creative tools for unlimited, private music creation.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "ace-step-ui stands out for ace-step, ai, and ai-music in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Ace-Step-UI is an open-source React/TypeScript interface for ACE-Step 1.5, enabling local AI music generation without cloud costs. It leverages a diffusion-based transformer model to produce high-quality audio from text prompts, with full control over generation parameters. Developers can run it locally via Docker or npm, customize the UI, and integrate it into creative tools for unlimited, private music creation.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/fspecii/ace-step-ui for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
